sequenceDiagram
    actor Student
    participant React as React Claim Page
    participant API as Express API
    participant Auth as Auth Middleware
    participant DB as MySQL
    Student->>React: Enter ownership evidence
    React->>API: POST /api/claims with itemReportId and evidence
    API->>Auth: Check authenticated session
    Auth-->>API: Student identity
    API->>DB: SELECT found report by id
    DB-->>API: Report owner/type/status
    API->>API: Validate not own report, FOUND, OPEN, not duplicate
    API->>DB: INSERT claim as PENDING
    DB-->>API: New claim id
    API-->>React: 201 Created + message
    React-->>Student: Show success and claim status
